1},{"name":16155},[16156,16157,16160,16161,16164],{"#text":1956},{"surname":16158},[16159],{"#text":12724},{"#text":1956},{"given-names":16162},[16163],{"#text":9662},{"#text":1891},{"#text":1891},{"name":16167},[16168,16169,16172,16173,16176],{"#text":1956},{"surname":16170},[16171],{"#text":12737},{"#text":1956},{"given-names":16174},[16175],{"#text":9354},{"#text":1891},{"#text":1891},{"name":16179},[16180,16181,16184,16185,16188],{"#text":1956},{"surname":16182},[16183],{"#text":12750},{"#text":1956},{"given-names":16186},[16187],{"#text":10160},{"#text":1891},{"#text":1891},{"name":16191},[16192,16193,16196,16197,16200],{"#text":1956},{"surname":16194},[16195],{"#text":12763},{"#text":1956},{"given-names":16198},[16199],{"#text":12768},{"#text":1891},{"#text":1891},{"name":16203},[16204,16205,16208,16209,16212],{"#text":1956},{"surname":16206},[16207],{"#text":12777},{"#text":1956},{"given-names":16210},[16211],{"#text":12782},{"#text":1891},{"#text":1891},{"etal":16215},[],{"#text":915},{"@_person-group-type":9103},{"#text":1846},{"year":16220},[16221],{"#text":12793},{"#text":9110},{"article-title":16224},[16225],{"#text":12798},{"#text":9116},{"source":16228},[16229],{"#text":10571},{"volume":16231},[16232],{"#text":12806},{"#text":2393},{"fpage":16235},[16236],{"#text":12811},{"#text":9243},{"lpage":16239},[16240],{"#text":12816},{"#text":9116},{"pub-id":16243,":@":16245},[16244],{"#text":12821},{"@_pub-id-type":9136},{"pub-id":16247,":@":16249},[16248],{"#text":12826},{"@_pub-id-type":9142},{"@_publication-type":9144},{"#text":885},[16253,16254,16255,16256,16257,16258],{"surname":12710,"givenNames":12715},{"surname":12724,"givenNames":9662},{"surname":12737,"givenNames":9354},{"surname":12750,"givenNames":10160},{"surname":12763,"givenNames":12768},{"surname":12777,"givenNames":12782},[16260,16317,16341,16348,16432,16576,16821,17097],{"id":2651,"type":16261,"title":2676,"description":16262,"descriptionNodes":16263,"altText":2760,"imageUrl":2766},"Figure","The root Parallel node (SuccessOnOne) runs the EStopMonitor safety leaf alongside RehabRoot, a second Parallel node (SuccessOnAll) that concurrently executes the perception and logging leaves–SkeletonTracker (body-joint tracking), HandPointingMetrics (real-time scoring), SessionAggregator (session-level aggregation), and RobotLinkTracker (robot kinematics logging) – together with the RehabPipeline subtree, which drives exercise execution through SendExercise.",[16264,16265,16316],{"#text":1891},{"p":16266},[16267,16268,16271,16272,16275,16276,16279,16280,16283,16284,16287,16288,16291,16292,16295,16296,16299,16300,16303,16304,16307,16308,16311,16312,16315],{"#text":2684},{"monospace":16269},[16270],{"#text":2642},{"#text":2689},{"monospace":16273},[16274],{"#text":2693},{"#text":2695},{"monospace":16277},[16278],{"#text":2612},{"#text":2700},{"monospace":16281},[16282],{"#text":2704},{"#text":2706},{"monospace":16285},[16286],{"#text":2642},{"#text":2689},{"monospace":16289},[16290],{"#text":2714},{"#text":2716},{"monospace":16293},[16294],{"#text":2720},{"#text":2722},{"monospace":16297},[16298],{"#text":2726},{"#text":2728},{"monospace":16301},[16302],{"#text":2732},{"#text":2734},{"monospace":16305},[16306],{"#text":2738},{"#text":2740},{"monospace":16309},[16310],{"#text":2744},{"#text":2746},{"monospace":16313},[16314],{"#text":2750},{"#text":2267},{"#text":915},{"id":3939,"type":16261,"title":3949,"description":16318,"descriptionNodes":16319,"altText":3990,"imageUrl":3994},"Per-repetition feedback generated by the Coach node for a representative subject across two consecutive sessions (three repetitions each). For every repetition, the table reports the repetition index (Rep), the numeric score (Punteggio), the qualitative outcome (Esito), and the corresponding natural-language feedback message given to the participant. In this example, all six repetitions across both sessions achieved the maximum score (100.0, GREAT), with the system varying the feedback phrasing between repetitions to avoid repetitive, mechanical-sounding encouragement.",[16320,16321,16340],{"#text":1891},{"p":16322},[16323,16324,16327,16328,16331,16332,16335,16336,16339],{"#text":3957},{"italic":16325},[16326],{"#text":3961},{"#text":3963},{"italic":16329},[16330],{"#text":3967},{"#text":3969},{"italic":16333},[16334],{"#text":3973},{"#text":3975},{"monospace":16337},[16338],{"#text":3979},{"#text":3981},{"#text":915},{"id":5894,"type":16261,"title":5940,"description":5948,"descriptionNodes":16342,"altText":5957,"imageUrl":5961},[16343,16344,16347],{"#text":1891},{"p":16345},[16346],{"#text":5948},{"#text":915},{"id":6795,"type":16261,"title":6874,"description":16349,"descriptionNodes":16350,"altText":6982,"imageUrl":6986},"(a) Per-repetition scores S (0–100 scale) derived from TIAGo onboard measurements (blue, solid boxes) and BTS mocap reference (orange, dashed boxes), stratified by group and session: Group A (high-performance) in sessions one and 2, and Group B (low-performance) in sessions one and 2. The difficulty level of each condition is indicated below the x-axis. Horizontal dotted lines mark the performance band boundaries (S=25, Fail; S=75, Great). Individual trial values are overlaid as dots. (b) Session-level mean scores (S̄, BTS reference) for Group A (blue) and Group B (red) across the two sessions. Arrows indicate the difficulty-level transition automatically applied by the Coach node between sessions: Group A was promoted to the Hard level, Group B was demoted to the Easy level.",[16351,16352,16431],{"#text":1891},{"p":16353},[16354,16355,16358,16359,16370,16371,16388,16389,16406,16407,16410,16411,16430],{"#text":1956},{"bold":16356},[16357],{"#text":6885},{"#text":6887},{"inline-formula":16360,":@":16369},[16361],{"mml:math":16362,":@":16368},[16363],{"mml:mrow":16364},[16365],{"mml:mi":16366},[16367],{"#text":3040},{"@_id":6898,"@_xmlns:mml":1472},{"@_id":6900},{"#text":6902},{"inline-formula":16372,":@":16387},[16373],{"mml:math":16374,":@":16386},[16375],{"mml:mrow":16376},[16377,16380,16383],{"mml:mi":16378},[16379],{"#text":3040},{"mml:mo":16381},[16382],{"#text":1657},{"mml:mn":16384},[16385],{"#text":3520},{"@_id":6919},{"@_id":6921},{"#text":6923},{"inline-formula":16390,":@":16405},[16391],{"mml:math":16392,":@":16404},[16393],{"mml:mrow":16394},[16395,16398,16401],{"mml:mi":16396},[16397],{"#text":3040},{"mml:mo":16399},[16400],{"#text":1657},{"mml:mn":16402},[16403],{"#text":3552},{"@_id":6940},{"@_id":6942},{"#text":6944},{"bold":16408},[16409],{"#text":6948},{"#text":6950},{"inline-formula":16412,":@":16429},[16413],{"mml:math":16414,":@":16428},[16415],{"mml:mrow":16416},[16417],{"mml:mover":16418,":@":16427},[16419,16424],{"mml:mrow":16420},[16421],{"mml:mi":16422},[16423],{"#text":3040},{"mml:mo":16425},[16426],{"#text":3646},{"@_accent":15},{"@_id":6969},{"@_id":6971},{"#text":6973},{"#text":915},{"id":6999,"type":16261,"title":7081,"description":16433,"descriptionNodes":16434,"altText":7252,"imageUrl":7256},"Continuous agreement between TIAGo-derived and mocap-derived kinematic signals for a representative repetition. Top: misalignment angle α(t), with the dashed line marking the operational threshold αth=10°. Bottom: hand–end-effector distance d(t); the vertical axis is zoomed to a range that keeps the signals visible; the dashed line here marks the data-driven physiological reference bound (≈0.35m, close to the 36.1 cm estimate reported in Section 3.2) rather than the operational scoring threshold (dth=0.50m), which lies outside the plotted range. The two measurement systems track each other closely throughout the repetition, remaining well below both the physiological reference and the (off-scale) operational threshold at all times, illustrating the continuous-level agreement underlying the perfect discrete band-classification accuracy reported in Section 3.1.",[16435,16436,16575],{"#text":1891},{"p":16437},[16438,16439,16465,16466,16495,16496,16522,16523,16537,16538,16542,1